<!--
    Voice-bot call button (chat toolbar). A headset-on-person "support agent" glyph rather
    than a plain handset, so the action reads as "call the assistant" and is not confused
    with the CPaaS template call button (ic_call), which keeps the generic phone icon.

    fillColor is white only as a sane pre-theme default: ChatActivity.onThemeChanged tints
    this at runtime with the channel's defaultTextColor, exactly like ic_arrow_back. Do not
    hardcode a dark colour here — the toolbar background is themed and was dark enough to
    swallow the old icon entirely.
-->
